    "title": "Keene affordable housing complex launches - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News Report ,\n12 hours ago KEENE | The first three homebuyers in the affordable-forever Both Meadow Trail project in Keene recently closed on their homes, marking an important step in easing that community’s housing shortage. Adirondack Roots, a nonprofit housing organization based in Elizabethtown, spearheaded the development of the four-home project off Route 73.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
